{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "132", "x": 0.8959551137550246, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03778813484861114, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "herds against attack from wolves rate the performance of the dogs as very good", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.826810260041217, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "or excellent. In a study carried out in Australia by Linda van Bommel and Chris", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8259680175457105, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Johnson at the University of Tasmania, more than 65 per cent of herders reported", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8261425150170862, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that predation stopped completely after they got the dogs, and almost all the rest", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.826055471331306, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "saw a decrease in attacks. 'If they are managed and used properly, livestock guard", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8262114117860432, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "dogs are the most efficient control method that we have in terms of the amount", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.8258160755641718, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of livestock that they save from predation,' says van Bommel.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.6262603264415034, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "D", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33133430071101805, "w": 0.02101269433220525, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "But today's guard dogs also have a new role - to help preserve the predators.", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.33133430071101805, "w": 0.7661738240874792, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It is hoped that reductions in livestock losses can make farmers more tolerant of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3596646507851557, "w": 0.8260771040965588, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "predators and less likely to kill them. In Namibia, more than 90 per cent of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.38799500085929334, "w": 0.826011898225939, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cheetahs live outside protected areas, close to humans raising livestock. As a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.41632538865482344, "w": 0.8265990586363792, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "result, the cheetahs are often held responsible for animal losses, and large", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4446557764503536, "w": 0.825924649490251, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "numbers have been killed by farmers. When guard dogs were introduced, more", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.47301087175797835, "w": 0.8259899578858247, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "than 90 per cent of farmers reported a dramatic reduction in livestock losses, and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5013412218321159, "w": 0.8262948670984402, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "said that as a result they were less likely to kill predators. Julie Young, at Utah", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5295232891122934, "w": 0.8257290318783914, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "State University in the US, believes this result applies widely. 'There is common", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.557853639186431, "w": 0.8260991469616269, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "ground from the livestock perspective and from the conservation perspective,'", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5861840269819611, "w": 0.8260115906510775, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "she says. 'If ranchers don't have a dead cow, they will not make a call to apply for", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6145143770560988, "w": 0.8262883055013968, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a permit to kill a wolf.'", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6428448025730215, "w": 0.22948209109485682, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "E", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6811501222399445, "w": 0.01919854090586743, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Looking at all the published evidence, Bethany Smith at Nottingham Trent", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.6811501222399445, "w": 0.765622342360963, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "University in the UK found that up to 88 per cent of farmers said they no longer", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7094804723140822, "w": 0.8258377083294246, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "killed predators after using dogs - but warned that such self-reported results", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7378108223882198, "w": 0.8267111184108878, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "must be taken with a pinch of salt. What's more, it is possible that livestock guard", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7661412479051425, "w": 0.826251396518027, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "dogs merely displace predators to unprotected neighbouring properties, where", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7944715979792801, "w": 0.8262075158377985, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "their fate isn't recorded. 'In some regions, we work with almost every farmer, but", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8228019480534177, "w": 0.8260020558303737, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in others only one or two have dogs,' says Ribeiro. 'If we are not working with", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8509839776122027, "w": 0.825968325120572, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "everybody, we are transferring the wolf pressure to the neighbour's herd and he", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8793390729198274, "w": 0.8258811789098378, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "can use poison and kill an entire pack of wolves.'", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.90766949843675, "w": 0.4965989653386712, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}